@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voime-gpu-qwen3" as Worker
participant "llama-cpp-4 / llama.cpp" as Llama
participant "模型目录\nqwen3-asr-1.7b" as Model

Worker -> Model : 读取 manifest.json
Worker -> Model : 校验 SHA-256
Worker -> Llama : LlamaBackend::init()
Llama --> Worker : backend
Worker -> Llama : LlamaModel::load_from_file(BF16 主模型)
Llama --> Worker : LlamaModel
Worker -> Llama : model.ftype()
Llama --> Worker : BF16
Worker -> Llama : MtmdContext::init_from_file(BF16 mmproj)
Llama --> Worker : MtmdContext
Worker -> Llama : capabilities(&model).audio / audio_sample_rate()
Llama --> Worker : true / 16000
Worker -> Llama : warmup（短静音）
Llama --> Worker : ok

note over Worker, Llama
  每次 Transcribe 复用已加载的模型与 mtmd 上下文；
  不重新加载权重，不展开 mtmd / prompt / decode 内部阶段。
end note
@enduml
